			description: [
				"Storage Drawers excel at abundant blocks, while cabinets and shelves communicate visually. Use bulk storage for stone, wood, crops and machine parts rather than every unique object."
				"Connect searchable storage only after assigning sensible categories. Networks make disorder faster to search, but they do not make it easier to maintain."
				"Leave room for growth and an obvious place for returns. The best storage room is the one tired explorers actually use."
